      "custom": true,
      "desc": "Warm up for 6–8 minutes: easy jogging or marching, ankle rocks, controlled squats, reverse lunges, then several gentle practice jumps. No equipment. Use a clear, level, nonslip area with enough overhead space. Stop for pain. End a jumping set when height or landing control drops. This routine supports jumping power; practice new flips with your coach."
